---
import AcademicsNavbar from '../../components/AcademicsNavbar.astro';
import AcademicsFooter from '../../components/AcademicsFooter.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>News & Updates | SPMH Academics</title>
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Open+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
    <style>
      * {
        font-family: 'Open Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      }
      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      h4,
      h5,
      h6 {
        font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class='bg-white text-slate-900'>
    <AcademicsNavbar />

    <main class='min-h-screen'>
      <div class='max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12'>
        <h1 class='text-4xl font-bold text-[#125276] mb-4'>News & Updates</h1>
        <p class='text-lg text-[#3E5262] mb-12'>
          Stay informed about the latest developments, announcements, and
          initiatives from SPMH's Academics & Partnerships portfolio.
        </p>

        <div class='mb-8 p-6 bg-[#E3F2FD] border border-[#90CAF9] rounded-lg'>
          <p class='text-[#1565c0] font-medium'>📢 Subscribe to updates</p>
          <p class='text-[#3E5262] text-sm mt-2'>
            Get partnership and academic announcements delivered to your inbox
            monthly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='space-y-6'>
          <!-- News 1 -->
          <article
            class='bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[#D8E0E7] hover:shadow-md transition-shadow'>
            <div class='p-6'>
              <div class='flex items-center gap-2 mb-3'>
                <span
                  class='bg-[#860f0f] text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full'
                  >Announcement</span
                >
                <span class='text-[#7A8A96] text-sm'>August 2026</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class='text-xl font-bold text-[#125276] mb-3'>
                New Academic Partnerships Program Launched
              </h2>
              <p class='text-[#3E5262] mb-4'>
                SPMH announces the launch of its formal Academic Partnerships
                Program to streamline collaboration with educational
                institutions across East Africa. The program includes structured
                pathways for student placements, research collaborations, and
                faculty exchange.
              </p>
              <div
                class='bg-[#F7F9FB] p-4 rounded border border-[#D8E0E7] mb-4 text-sm text-[#3E5262]'>
                <p>
                  <strong>Key Features:</strong> Standardized MOU framework | Enhanced
                  mentorship protocols | Accreditation support for partner institutions
                </p>
              </div>
              <a
                href='#'
                class='text-[#1565c0] hover:underline font-medium text-sm'
                >Learn more →</a
              >
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- News 2 -->
          <article
            class='bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[#D8E0E7] hover:shadow-md transition-shadow'>
            <div class='p-6'>
              <div class='flex items-center gap-2 mb-3'>
                <span
                  class='bg-[#860f0f] text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full'
                  >Achievement</span
                >
                <span class='text-[#7A8A96] text-sm'>July 2026</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class='text-xl font-bold text-[#125276] mb-3'>
                SPMH Reaches 500+ Student Placements Milestone
              </h2>
              <p class='text-[#3E5262] mb-4'>
                In recognition of clinical education excellence, SPMH has hosted
                over 500 nursing, medical, and allied health students in the
                past three years. The milestone reflects our commitment to
                developing the healthcare workforce and building professional
                capacity across the region.
              </p>
              <div
                class='bg-[#F7F9FB] p-4 rounded border border-[#D8E0E7] mb-4 text-sm text-[#3E5262]'>
                <p>
                  <strong>Statistics:</strong> 250+ nursing students | 120+ medical
                  interns | 90+ allied health professionals | 40+ research scholars
                </p>
              </div>
              <a
                href='#'
                class='text-[#1565c0] hover:underline font-medium text-sm'
                >Read full story →</a
              >
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- News 3 -->
          <article
            class='bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[#D8E0E7] hover:shadow-md transition-shadow'>
            <div class='p-6'>
              <div class='flex items-center gap-2 mb-3'>
                <span
                  class='bg-[#860f0f] text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full'
                  >Research</span
                >
                <span class='text-[#7A8A96] text-sm'>June 2026</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class='text-xl font-bold text-[#125276] mb-3'>
                Joint Research Study on Maternal Health Outcomes Published
              </h2>
              <p class='text-[#3E5262] mb-4'>
                Findings from a collaborative research project between SPMH and
                University of Cape Town have been published in the Journal of
                Global Health. The study examined effectiveness of integrated
                maternal health interventions in rural settings.
              </p>
              <div
                class='bg-[#F7F9FB] p-4 rounded border border-[#D8E0E7] mb-4 text-sm text-[#3E5262]'>
                <p>
                  <strong>Citation:</strong> "Integrated Maternal Health Interventions
                  in Low-Resource Settings: Evidence from Western Kenya" - Journal
                  of Global Health, 2026
                </p>
              </div>
              <a
                href='#'
                class='text-[#1565c0] hover:underline font-medium text-sm'
                >View publication →</a
              >
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- News 4 -->
          <article
            class='bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[#D8E0E7] hover:shadow-md transition-shadow'>
            <div class='p-6'>
              <div class='flex items-center gap-2 mb-3'>
                <span
                  class='bg-[#860f0f] text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full'
                  >Event</span
                >
                <span class='text-[#7A8A96] text-sm'
                  >Upcoming - September 2026</span
                >
              </div>
              <h2 class='text-xl font-bold text-[#125276] mb-3'>
                Annual Academic Partnerships Symposium 2026
              </h2>
              <p class='text-[#3E5262] mb-4'>
                SPMH will host its annual symposium bringing together academic
                and institutional partners to share experiences, discuss
                emerging trends in health professions education, and strengthen
                collaboration networks. Registration is now open.
              </p>
              <div
                class='bg-[#F7F9FB] p-4 rounded border border-[#D8E0E7] mb-4 text-sm text-[#3E5262]'>
                <p>
                  <strong>Event Details:</strong> September 18-19, 2026 | SPMH Conference
                  Center | Hybrid participation available
                </p>
              </div>
              <a
                href='#'
                class='text-[#1565c0] hover:underline font-medium text-sm'
                >Register now →</a
              >
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- News 5 -->
          <article
            class='bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[#D8E0E7] hover:shadow-md transition-shadow'>
            <div class='p-6'>
              <div class='flex items-center gap-2 mb-3'>
                <span
                  class='bg-[#860f0f] text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full'
                  >Update</span
                >
                <span class='text-[#7A8A96] text-sm'>May 2026</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class='text-xl font-bold text-[#125276] mb-3'>
                Expanded Clinical Placement Opportunities for 2026-2027
              </h2>
              <p class='text-[#3E5262] mb-4'>
                Due to increased staffing and infrastructure development, SPMH
                is expanding clinical placement capacity for the 2026-2027
                academic year. We are now accepting applications for placements
                across all clinical departments.
              </p>
              <div
                class='bg-[#F7F9FB] p-4 rounded border border-[#D8E0E7] mb-4 text-sm text-[#3E5262]'>
                <p>
                  <strong>Available Positions:</strong> Nursing (40 slots) | Medical
                  (15 slots) | Pharmacy (10 slots) | Laboratory (8 slots) | Radiology
                  (6 slots)
                </p>
              </div>
              <a
                href='/academics-and-partnerships/apply-for-attachment'
                class='text-[#1565c0] hover:underline font-medium text-sm'
                >Apply now →</a
              >
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class='bg-[#F7F9FB] border border-[#D8E0E7] rounded-lg p-8 mt-12'>
          <h2 class='text-xl font-bold text-[#125276] mb-4'>
            Want regular updates?
          </h2>
          <p class='text-[#3E5262] mb-4'>
            Subscribe to our newsletter to receive monthly updates on
            partnerships, academic initiatives, and institutional news.
          </p>
          <form class='flex gap-2'>
            <input
              type='email'
              placeholder='Enter your email'
              class='flex-1 px-4 py-2 border border-[#D8E0E7] rounded focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#1565c0]/30'
            />
            <button
              type='submit'
              class='bg-[#860f0f] text-white px-6 py-2 rounded font-medium hover:bg-[#660a0a] transition-colors'>
              Subscribe
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <AcademicsFooter />
  </body>
</html>
